               "id": "87f5f133-067e-439f-ab1d-eaf45e304079",
               "name": "When size matters",
               "desc": "In this text, we learn the rule that tells which of two numbers is greater or smaller, we measure objects with a ruler, and we see that two objects are fully equal only when they match in every characteristic we compare.",
               "date_time": null
            },
            {
               "family_id": "",
               "person_id": "",
               "id": "03bb4b8e-6187-4572-8f00-ea3892df51a4",
               "name": "Comparing in more than one direction",
               "desc": "In this text, we learn to compare two objects in more than one direction, measuring width and height and comparing color, and we see that they are fully equal only when they match in every direction that matters.",
               "date_time": null
            }
         ],
         "date_time": null
      },
